  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed rear extension, by reason of its depth, height and siting along the shared boundary of No. 87 Monmouth Road, would appear overbearing and result in an unacceptable loss of outlook and sense of enclosure to that neighbouring property. The development would therefore cause material harm to residential amenity, contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2021), Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policy DMD8, DMD11 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
